{"code":"10.0152","total":52,"shared":0,"cells":4,"forms":{"Lat.00":{"n":49,"e":[["darshana/vedanta/vishishtadvaita/sudarshana_suri/shruta_prakashika/bhashya","unit_0100","घारयति","…न, “यदाग्नेयोऽष्टाकपालः \", \"उपरि हि देवेभ्यो घारयति\" इति वाक्यवदिदं महोपनिषद्वाक्यमपि अप्राप्तार…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/krishna_yajurveda/katha_shakha/samhita/katha_samhita","23.1.3","घारयति","यदभ्यनक्त्यभ्येवैनं घारयति मेध्यत्वाय",""],["vedas/yajurveda/krishna_yajurveda/taittiriya_shakha/aranyaka/taittiriya_aranyaka","0.5.8.70","घारयति","…्ञिया॑य॒ शं यजु॑र्भि॒रित्या॑ह । अ॒भ्ये॑वैनं॑ घारयति । अथो॑ ह॒विरे॒वाकः॑",""],["vedas/yajurveda/krishna_yajurveda/taittiriya_shakha/brahmana/taittiriya_brahmana","3.3.5.2","घारयति","…े॑क्षेत । दा॒धारा॒त्मन्चक्षुः॑ । अ॒भ्याज्यं॑ घारयति । आज्यं॑ गृह्णाति",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.10","घारयति","तूष्णीं तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयो मू᳘लं यज्ञ᳘स्य तूष्णी᳘मिव᳘ हीदं मू᳘लं᳘…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.11","घारयति","म᳘न्त्रेण तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयः शि᳘रो यज्ञ᳘स्य व्वाग्घि म᳘न्त्रः शीर्ष…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.12","घारयति","(त्या᳘) आ᳘सीनस्तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयो मू᳘लं यज्ञ᳘स्य नि᳘षणमिव᳘ हीदं मू᳘लं ति…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.3","घारयति","स्रुवे᳘ण तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयं म᳘नस ऽआघार᳘यति व्वृ᳘षा हि म᳘नो व्वृ᳘षा…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.4","घारयति","स्रुचा तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयं᳘ व्वाच᳘ ऽआघार᳘यति यो᳘षा हि व्वाग्यो᳘षा…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.5","घारयति","(क्तू) तूष्णीं तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयं म᳘नस ऽआघार᳘यति न स्वाहे᳘ति चना᳘निरुक्त…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.6","घारयति","म᳘न्त्रेण तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयं᳘ व्वाच᳘ ऽआघार᳘यति नि᳘रुक्ता हि व्वाङ्न…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.7","घारयति","(ऽ) आ᳘सीनस्तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयं म᳘नस ऽआघार᳘यति ति᳘ष्ठस्तं यं᳘ व्वाचे म…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.8","घारयति","…िव हि᳘ व्वी᳘र्यं त᳘स्माद्दक्षिणतस्ति᳘ष्ठन्ना᳘घारयति स य᳘दुभय᳘त ऽआघार᳘यति त᳘स्मादिदं म᳘नश्च व्वा᳘…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.4.4.9","घारयति","स्रुवे᳘ण तमा᳘घारयति॥  \nयो मू᳘लं यज्ञ᳘स्य स्रुचा तमा᳘घारयति यः शि…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.5.3.25","घारयति","…ं᳘ प्रयाज᳘मिष्ट्वा᳘ यथापूर्व᳘ᳫँ᳭हवी᳘ᳫं᳘ष्यभि᳘घारयति पु᳘नरे᳘वैनानि तदा᳘प्याययत्य᳘यातयामानि करोत्य…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.6.1.21","घारयति","…द्वि᳘र्हवि᳘षो ऽवदाया᳘थोप᳘रिष्टादा᳘ज्यस्याभि᳘घारयति᳘ सैषा᳘ज्येन मिश्रा᳘हुतिर्हूयते य᳘जमानेन है᳘व…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.7.2.10","घारयति","…द्वि᳘र्हवि᳘षो ऽवदाया᳘थोप᳘रिष्टादा᳘ज्यस्याभि᳘घारयति द्वे वा ऽआ᳘हुती सोमाहुति᳘रे᳘वा᳘न्याज्याहुति᳘…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_01/mula","1.7.4.11","घारयति","…द्वि᳘र्हवि᳘षोवदाया᳘थोप᳘रिष्टादा᳘ज्यस्याभि᳘घारयति तद्य᳘थैव᳘ यज्ञ᳘स्यावदा᳘नमेव᳘मेव तत्॥",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_yajurveda/vajasaneyi_madhyandina_shakha/brahmana/shatapatha_brahmana/kanda_02/mula","2.4.4.24","घारयति","(त्य᳘) अ᳘थ दि᳘शो व्या᳘घारयति॥  \nदि᳘शः प्र᳘दिश ऽआदि᳘शो व्विदि᳘श ऽउद्दि᳘शो…",""],["vedas/yajurveda/shukla_